{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/83249-ideas","id":83249,"title":"Ideas!","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-03-03T09:43:22-08:00","id":83249,"title":"Ideas!","content":"<div style=\"margin-left:40px\">So I'd really like to do something with Aberrant or Trinity. Give me your cool, interesting, clever story ideas.</div> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/286-christian-a","name":"Christian A","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"832"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-03T17:25:12-08:00","id":83613,"title":"","content":"All the weirdness is caused by one temporal oddity.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2239-lyre","name":"lyre","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-04T10:38:24-08:00","id":84051,"title":"","content":"Heh. I think you'll like the core, Iyre.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Neall Raemonn Price</span><br /> Beleaguered Scion Developer</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/137-neall","name":"Neall","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar137_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1204"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-05T06:41:49-08:00","id":84541,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Christian A</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/83249-ideas#post83249\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><div style=\"margin-left:40px\">So I'd really like to do something with Aberrant or Trinity. Give me your cool, interesting, clever story ideas.</div></div> </div> </div> </div>Maybe flip the story on its head?<br /> <br /> Like ... T2M and all the other vaguely good guy organizations are actually totalitarian fascists who use their humanitarian airs as a cover for the fact that they just want to control the development of Nova and, through them, humanity at large. <br /> <br /> The only people who follow the truth are the Teragen with the charismatic Divis Mal as their leader. Will they be able to show humanity the truth in enough time to stop T2M's stranglehold on unfolding events?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/42-aranis","name":"Aranis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar42_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"229"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-05T16:22:46-08:00","id":84910,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aranis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/83249-ideas?p=84541#post84541\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Maybe flip the story on its head?<br /> <br /> Like ... T2M and all the other vaguely good guy organizations are actually totalitarian fascists who use their humanitarian airs as a cover for the fact that they just want to control the development of Nova and, through them, humanity at large.<br /> <br /> The only people who follow the truth are the Teragen with the charismatic Divis Mal as their leader. Will they be able to show humanity the truth in enough time to stop T2M's stranglehold on unfolding events?</div> </div> </div> </div>To be fair, there's a little bit of truth in that interpretation already. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2318-johntfs","name":"johntfs","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"373"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-09T00:22:31-08:00","id":87312,"title":"","content":"Trinity tells that the Doyen created the PSI orders as a weapon against the aberrants.<br /> <br /> But what if a species with a grudge against the doyen first gave Dr. Hammersmith a bit of help building his telluric engine...but included a few <i>tiny </i>flaws that would ensure an explosion and the creation of the Novas?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1457-quanutmshard","name":"Quanutmshard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1457_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"61"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-09T01:32:17-08:00","id":87355,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Quanutmshard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/83249-ideas?p=87312#post87312\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Trinity tells that the Doyen created the PSI orders as a weapon against the aberrants.<br /> <br /> But what if a species with a grudge against the doyen first gave Dr. Hammersmith a bit of help building his telluric engine...but included a few <i>tiny </i>flaws that would ensure an explosion and the creation of the Novas?</div> </div> </div> </div>A young reporter for Toronto's <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Daily_Star_(DC_Comics)\" target=\"_blank\">Daily Star</a> newspaper discovers he has the ability to lift unimaginably heavy objects. His great muscles allow him to outrun bullets and even make great leaps tall enough to clear buildings.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Ian A. A. Watson</span></b><span style=\"color:#bdc3c7\">(he/she)</span><br /> <b>Onyx Path Community Manager<br /> Trinity Continuum Content Lead</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4-ianwatson","name":"IanWatson","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4_2.png","title":"Community Manager","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1512"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-09T03:36:33-07:00","id":87397,"title":"","content":"There are no &quot;daredevils&quot; -- just mesmerists and/or stalwarts with mental blocks. Alternately, daredevils are actually Awakened. (Ever heard of Doc Eon? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />)<br /> <br /> Psiads are the real power in Project Utopia, subtly directing the Novas and helping them avoid Taint. Their intentions are benign, but they can be quite ruthless in covering up their existence.<br /> <br /> There are a lot fewer novas involved in the &quot;Aberrant&quot; attacks on Earth space than believed. The return of the Aberrants is actually a Qin conspiracy to unite humanity against a far greater threat -- the Coalition, which is an existential threat to humans and Qin alike.<br /> <br /> Hope those provide a bit of Inspiration. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Heroes die. Hope is a phoenix.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2434-captain-aeon","name":"Captain Aeon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2434_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"203"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-20T11:17:41-07:00","id":95084,"title":"","content":"Not necessarily Aberrant or Trinity, but mostly for Adventure!:<br /> <br /> There are rumors that the Forge of Hephaestus has been discovered by intrepid explorers, and it is fueled by the Eternal Fires of Yanartas!<br /> <br /> Many of the strange things in the world are attributed to the aftereffects of the Hammersmith Incident, but the Catatumbo lightning storm is not dying off in strength -- it seems to slowly be gaining strength! It isn't a result of the Telluric energy from Hammersmith's experiment, it's actually a result of the Telluric energy from Process 418 -- remember, Telluric energy can move forward AND BACKWARD through time!<br /> <br /> Divis Mal creates the Teragen in the Aberrant Age not as a means of espousing &quot;nova superiority&quot;, but in actuality it is in order to keep novas from over-interfering in baseline society -- because he thinks this is what Maxwell Mercer had asked him to do decades earlier! (Adventure! p. 104, point 4)<br /> <br /> Don't you dare forget about Tutankhamen's Tomb, discovered only months after the Hammersmith Incident. Who knows how much Telluric Energy the Valley of the Kings could have collected?<br /> <br /> I wonder what could have caused the sudden eruption of Mount Etna in the 1920s...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2464-lustral_star","name":"lustral_star","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2464_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"302"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}